"Style of aligning consecutive TableGen definition colons. This aligns the "
"inheritance colons of consecutive definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1519
msgid ""
"**AlignEscapedNewlines** (`EscapedNewlineAlignmentStyle`) {versionbadge}"
"`clang-format 5` {ref}`¶ <AlignEscapedNewlines>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1521
msgid "Options for aligning backslashes in escaped newlines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1525
msgid ""
"`ENAS_DontAlign` (in configuration: `DontAlign`) Don't align escaped "
"newlines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1535
msgid ""
"`ENAS_Left` (in configuration: `Left`) Align escaped newlines as far left as "
"possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1545
msgid ""
"`ENAS_LeftWithLastLine` (in configuration: `LeftWithLastLine`) Align escaped "
"newlines as far left as possible, using the last line of the preprocessor "
"directive as the reference if it's the longest."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1556
msgid ""
"`ENAS_Right` (in configuration: `Right`) Align escaped newlines in the right-"
"most column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1570
msgid ""
"**AlignOperands** (`OperandAlignmentStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 3.5` "
"{ref}`¶ <AlignOperands>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1572
msgid ""
"If `true`, horizontally align operands of binary and ternary expressions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1577
msgid ""
"`OAS_DontAlign` (in configuration: `DontAlign`) Do not align operands of "
"binary and ternary expressions. The wrapped lines are indented "
"`ContinuationIndentWidth` spaces from the start of the line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1582
msgid ""
"`OAS_Align` (in configuration: `Align`) Horizontally align operands of "
"binary and ternary expressions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1585
msgid ""
"Specifically, this aligns operands of a single expression that needs to be "
"split over multiple lines, e.g.:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1593
msgid ""
"When `BreakBeforeBinaryOperators` is set, the wrapped operator is aligned "
"with the operand on the first line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1601
msgid ""
"`OAS_AlignAfterOperator` (in configuration: `AlignAfterOperator`) "
"Horizontally align operands of binary and ternary expressions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1604
msgid ""
"This is similar to `OAS_Align`, except when `BreakBeforeBinaryOperators` is "
"set, the operator is un-indented so that the wrapped operand is aligned with "
"the operand on the first line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1617
msgid ""
"**AlignTrailingComments** (`TrailingCommentsAlignmentStyle`) {versionbadge}"
"`clang-format 3.7` {ref}`¶ <AlignTrailingComments>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1619
msgid "Control of trailing comments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1621
msgid ""
"The alignment stops at closing braces after a line break, and only followed "
"by other closing braces, a (`do-`) `while`, a lambda call, or a semicolon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1626
msgid ""
"As of clang-format 16 this option is not a bool but can be set to the "
"options. Conventional bool options still can be parsed as before."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1639
msgid "Alignment options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1641
msgid ""
"`TrailingCommentsAlignmentKinds Kind` Specifies the way to align trailing "
"comments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1646
msgid ""
"`TCAS_Leave` (in configuration: `Leave`) Leave trailing comments as they are."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1657
msgid "`TCAS_Always` (in configuration: `Always`) Align trailing comments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1668
msgid ""
"`TCAS_Never` (in configuration: `Never`) Don't align trailing comments but "
"other formatter applies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1680
msgid ""
"`unsigned OverEmptyLines` How many empty lines to apply alignment. When both "
"`MaxEmptyLinesToKeep` and `OverEmptyLines` are set to 2, it formats like "
"below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1693
msgid ""
"When `MaxEmptyLinesToKeep` is set to 2 and `OverEmptyLines` is set to 1, it "
"formats like below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1705
msgid ""
"`bool AlignPPAndNotPP` If comments following preprocessor directive should "
"be aligned with comments that don't."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1718
msgid ""
"**AllowAllArgumentsOnNextLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 9` "
"{ref}`¶ <AllowAllArgumentsOnNextLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1720
msgid ""
"If a function call or braced initializer list doesn't fit on a line, allow "
"putting all arguments onto the next line, even if `BinPackArguments` is "
"`false`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1738
msgid ""
"**AllowAllConstructorInitializersOnNextLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}"
"`clang-format 9` {ref}`¶ <AllowAllConstructorInitializersOnNextLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1740
msgid ""
"This option is **deprecated**. See `NextLine` of "
"`PackConstructorInitializers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1745
msgid ""
"**AllowAllParametersOfDeclarationOnNextLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}"
"`clang-format 3.3` {ref}`¶ <AllowAllParametersOfDeclarationOnNextLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1747
msgid ""
"If the function declaration doesn't fit on a line, allow putting all "
"parameters of a function declaration onto the next line even if "
"`BinPackParameters` is `OnePerLine`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1766
msgid ""
"**AllowBreakBeforeNoexceptSpecifier** (`BreakBeforeNoexceptSpecifierStyle`) "
"{versionbadge}`clang-format 18` {ref}`¶ <AllowBreakBeforeNoexceptSpecifier>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1768
msgid "Controls if there could be a line break before a `noexcept` specifier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1772
msgid "`BBNSS_Never` (in configuration: `Never`) No line break allowed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1784
msgid ""
"`BBNSS_OnlyWithParen` (in configuration: `OnlyWithParen`) For a simple "
"`noexcept` there is no line break allowed, but when we have a condition it "
"is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1797
msgid ""
"`BBNSS_Always` (in configuration: `Always`) Line breaks are allowed. But "
"note that because of the associated penalties `clang-format` often prefers "
"not to break before the `noexcept`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1815
msgid ""
"**AllowBreakBeforeQtProperty** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 22` "
"{ref}`¶ <AllowBreakBeforeQtProperty>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1817
msgid ""
"Allow breaking before `Q_Property` keywords `READ`, `WRITE`, etc. as if they "
"were preceded by a comma (`,`). This allows them to be formatted according "
"to `BinPackParameters`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1823
msgid ""
"**AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine** (`ShortBlockStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 3.5` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1825
msgid ""
"Dependent on the value, `while (true) { continue; }` can be put on a single "
"line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1830
msgid ""
"`SBS_Never` (in configuration: `Never`) Never merge blocks into a single "
"line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1841
msgid "`SBS_Empty` (in configuration: `Empty`) Only merge empty blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1851
msgid ""
"`SBS_Always` (in configuration: `Always`) Always merge short blocks into a "
"single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1863
msgid ""
"**AllowShortCaseExpressionOnASingleLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 19` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortCaseExpressionOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1865
msgid "Whether to merge a short switch labeled rule into a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1879
msgid ""
"**AllowShortCaseLabelsOnASingleLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 3.6` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortCaseLabelsOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1881
msgid "If `true`, short case labels will be contracted to a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1896
msgid ""
"**AllowShortCompoundRequirementOnASingleLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}"
"`clang-format 18` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortCompoundRequirementOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1898
msgid "Allow short compound requirement on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1918
msgid ""
"**AllowShortEnumsOnASingleLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 11` "
"{ref}`¶ <AllowShortEnumsOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1920
msgid "Allow short enums on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1935
msgid ""
"**AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine** (`ShortFunctionStyle`) {versionbadge}"
"`clang-format 3.5` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1937
msgid ""
"Dependent on the value, `int f() { return 0; }` can be put on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1942
msgid ""
"Different styles for merging short functions containing at most one "
"statement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1945
msgid "They can be read as a whole for compatibility. The choices are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1947
msgid "`None` Never merge functions into a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1950
msgid ""
"`InlineOnly` Only merge functions defined inside a class. Same as `inline`, "
"except it does not imply `empty`: i.e. top level empty functions are not "
"merged either. See `Inline` of `ShortFunctionStyle`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1966
msgid ""
"`Empty` Only merge empty functions. See `Empty` of `ShortFunctionStyle`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1976
msgid ""
"`Inline` Only merge functions defined inside a class. Implies `empty`. See "
"`Inline` and `Empty` of `ShortFunctionStyle`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:1990
msgid "`All` Merge all functions fitting on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2000
msgid "Also can be specified as a nested configuration flag:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2013
msgid "`bool Empty` Merge top-level empty functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2023
msgid "`bool Inline` Merge functions defined inside a class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2037
msgid ""
"`bool Other` Merge all functions fitting on a single line. Please note that "
"this control does not include Empty"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2050
msgid ""
"**AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine** (`ShortIfStyle`) {versionbadge}"
"`clang-format 3.3` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2052
msgid "Dependent on the value, `if (a) return;` can be put on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2056
msgid ""
"`SIS_Never` (in configuration: `Never`) Never put short ifs on the same line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2075
msgid ""
"`SIS_WithoutElse` (in configuration: `WithoutElse`) Put short ifs on the "
"same line only if there is no else statement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2093
msgid ""
"`SIS_OnlyFirstIf` (in configuration: `OnlyFirstIf`) Put short ifs, but not "
"else ifs nor else statements, on the same line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2111
msgid ""
"`SIS_AllIfsAndElse` (in configuration: `AllIfsAndElse`) Always put short "
"ifs, else ifs and else statements on the same line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2131
msgid ""
"**AllowShortLambdasOnASingleLine** (`ShortLambdaStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 9` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortLambdasOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2133
msgid ""
"Dependent on the value, `auto lambda []() { return 0; }` can be put on a "
"single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2138
msgid ""
"`SLS_None` (in configuration: `None`) Never merge lambdas into a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2141
msgid "`SLS_Empty` (in configuration: `Empty`) Only merge empty lambdas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2151
msgid ""
"`SLS_Inline` (in configuration: `Inline`) Merge lambda into a single line if "
"the lambda is argument of a function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2161
msgid ""
"`SLS_All` (in configuration: `All`) Merge all lambdas fitting on a single "
"line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2173
msgid ""
"**AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-format "
"3.7` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2175
msgid "If `true`, `while (true) continue;` can be put on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2180
msgid ""
"**AllowShortNamespacesOnASingleLine** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 20` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortNamespacesOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2182
msgid "If `true`, `namespace a { class b; }` can be put on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2186
msgid ""
"**AllowShortRecordOnASingleLine** (`ShortRecordStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 23` {ref}`¶ <AllowShortRecordOnASingleLine>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2188
msgid ""
"Dependent on the value, `struct bar { int i; };` can be put on a single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2193
msgid ""
"`SRS_Never` (in configuration: `Never`) Never merge records into a single "
"line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2196
msgid ""
"`SRS_EmptyAndAttached` (in configuration: `EmptyAndAttached`) Only merge "
"empty records if the opening brace was not wrapped, i.e. the corresponding "
"`BraceWrapping.After...` option was not set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2200
msgid "`SRS_Empty` (in configuration: `Empty`) Only merge empty records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2211
msgid ""
"`SRS_Always` (in configuration: `Always`) Merge all records that fit on a "
"single line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2223
msgid ""
"**AlwaysBreakAfterDefinitionReturnType** "
"(`DefinitionReturnTypeBreakingStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 3.7` {ref}"
"`¶ <AlwaysBreakAfterDefinitionReturnType>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2225
msgid ""
"The function definition return type breaking style to use.  This option is "
"**deprecated** and is retained for backwards compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2230
msgid ""
"`DRTBS_None` (in configuration: `None`) Break after return type "
"automatically. `PenaltyReturnTypeOnItsOwnLine` is taken into account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2234
msgid ""
"`DRTBS_All` (in configuration: `All`) Always break after the return type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2237
msgid ""
"`DRTBS_TopLevel` (in configuration: `TopLevel`) Always break after the "
"return types of top-level functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2244
msgid ""
"**AlwaysBreakAfterReturnType** (`deprecated`) {versionbadge}`clang-format "
"3.8` {ref}`¶ <AlwaysBreakAfterReturnType>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2246
msgid "This option is renamed to `BreakAfterReturnType`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2250
msgid ""
"**AlwaysBreakBeforeMultilineStrings** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 3.4` {ref}`¶ <AlwaysBreakBeforeMultilineStrings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2252
msgid "If `true`, always break before multiline string literals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2254
msgid ""
"This flag is mean to make cases where there are multiple multiline strings "
"in a file look more consistent. Thus, it will only take effect if wrapping "
"the string at that point leads to it being indented "
"`ContinuationIndentWidth` spaces from the start of the line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2268
msgid ""
"**AlwaysBreakTemplateDeclarations** (`deprecated`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 3.4` {ref}`¶ <AlwaysBreakTemplateDeclarations>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2270
msgid "This option is renamed to `BreakTemplateDeclarations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2274
msgid ""
"**AttributeMacros** (`List of Strings`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 12` {ref}"
"`¶ <AttributeMacros>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2276
msgid ""
"A vector of strings that should be interpreted as attributes/qualifiers "
"instead of identifiers. This can be useful for language extensions or static "
"analyzer annotations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2280
msgid "For example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2288
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:4578
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:4602
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:8025
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:8107
msgid "In the .clang-format configuration file, this can be configured like:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2296
msgid ""
"**BinPackArguments** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 3.7` {ref}`¶ "
"<BinPackArguments>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2298
msgid "This option is **deprecated**. See `BinPack` of `PackArguments`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2302
msgid ""
"**BinPackLongBracedList** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 21` {ref}"
"`¶ <BinPackLongBracedList>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2304
msgid ""
"If `BinPackLongBracedList` is `true` it overrides `BinPackArguments` if "
"there are 20 or more items in a braced initializer list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2321
msgid ""
"**BinPackParameters** (`BinPackParametersStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-format "
"3.7` {ref}`¶ <BinPackParameters>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2323
msgid "This option is **deprecated**. See `BinPack` of `PackParameters`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2327
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:6194
msgid "`BPPS_BinPack` (in configuration: `BinPack`) Bin-pack parameters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2335
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:6202
msgid ""
"`BPPS_OnePerLine` (in configuration: `OnePerLine`) Put all parameters on the "
"current line if they fit. Otherwise, put each one on its own line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2347
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:6214
msgid ""
"`BPPS_AlwaysOnePerLine` (in configuration: `AlwaysOnePerLine`) Always put "
"each parameter on its own line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2356
#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:6223
msgid ""
"`BPPS_UseBreakAfter` (in configuration: `UseBreakAfter`) Use the "
"`BreakAfter` option to handle parameter packing instead. If the `BreakAfter` "
"limit is not exceeded, behave like `BinPack`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2364
msgid ""
"**BitFieldColonSpacing** (`BitFieldColonSpacingStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 12` {ref}`¶ <BitFieldColonSpacing>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2366
msgid "The BitFieldColonSpacingStyle to use for bitfields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2370
msgid ""
"`BFCS_Both` (in configuration: `Both`) Add one space on each side of the `:`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2377
msgid ""
"`BFCS_None` (in configuration: `None`) Add no space around the `:` (except "
"when needed for `AlignConsecutiveBitFields`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2385
msgid ""
"`BFCS_Before` (in configuration: `Before`) Add space before the `:` only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2392
msgid ""
"`BFCS_After` (in configuration: `After`) Add space after the `:` only (space "
"may be added before if needed for `AlignConsecutiveBitFields`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2404
msgid ""
"**BraceWrapping** (`BraceWrappingFlags`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 3.8` "
"{ref}`¶ <BraceWrapping>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2406
msgid "Control of individual brace wrapping cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2408
msgid ""
"If `BreakBeforeBraces` is set to `Custom`, use this to specify how each "
"individual brace case should be handled. Otherwise, this is ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2422
msgid "Precise control over the wrapping of braces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2431
msgid "`bool AfterCaseLabel` Wrap case labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2448
msgid "`bool AfterClass` Wrap class definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2459
msgid ""
"`BraceWrappingAfterControlStatementStyle AfterControlStatement` Wrap control "
"statements (`if`/`for`/`while`/`switch`/..)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2464
msgid ""
"`BWACS_Never` (in configuration: `Never`) Never wrap braces after a control "
"statement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2475
msgid ""
"`BWACS_MultiLine` (in configuration: `MultiLine`) Only wrap braces after a "
"multi-line control statement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2488
msgid ""
"`BWACS_Always` (in configuration: `Always`) Always wrap braces after a "
"control statement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2501
msgid "`bool AfterEnum` Wrap enum definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2514
msgid "`bool AfterFunction` Wrap function definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2531
msgid "`bool AfterNamespace` Wrap namespace definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2548
msgid ""
"`bool AfterObjCDeclaration` Wrap ObjC definitions (interfaces, "
"implementations...)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2551
msgid ""
"@autoreleasepool and @synchronized blocks are wrapped according to "
"`AfterControlStatement` flag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2555
msgid "`bool AfterRequiresExpression` Wrap requires expression body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2572
msgid "`bool AfterStruct` Wrap struct definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2587
msgid "`bool AfterUnion` Wrap union definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2602
msgid "`bool AfterExportBlock` Wrap export blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2612
msgid "`bool AfterExternBlock` Wrap extern blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2627
msgid "`bool BeforeCatch` Wrap before `catch`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2644
msgid "`bool BeforeElse` Wrap before `else`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2659
msgid "`bool BeforeLambdaBody` Wrap lambda block."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2677
msgid "`bool BeforeWhile` Wrap before `while`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2692
msgid "`bool IndentBraces` Indent the wrapped braces themselves."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2694
msgid ""
"`bool SplitEmptyFunction` If `false`, empty function body can be put on a "
"single line. This option is used only if the opening brace of the function "
"has already been wrapped, i.e. the `AfterFunction` brace wrapping mode is "
"set, and the function could/should not be put on a single line (as per "
"`AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine` and constructor formatting options)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2708
msgid ""
"`bool SplitEmptyRecord` If `false`, empty record (e.g. class, struct or "
"union) body can be put on a single line. This option is used only if the "
"opening brace of the record has already been wrapped, i.e. the `AfterClass` "
"(for classes) brace wrapping mode is set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2720
msgid ""
"`bool SplitEmptyNamespace` If `false`, empty namespace body can be put on a "
"single line. This option is used only if the opening brace of the namespace "
"has already been wrapped, i.e. the `AfterNamespace` brace wrapping mode is "
"set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:2735
