"operators that aren't assignments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3145
msgid "`BOS_All` (in configuration: `All`) Break before operators."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3163
msgid ""
"**BreakBeforeBraces** (`BraceBreakingStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-format "
"3.7` {ref}`¶ <BreakBeforeBraces>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3165
msgid "The brace breaking style to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3169
msgid ""
"`BS_Attach` (in configuration: `Attach`) Always attach braces to surrounding "
"context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3216
msgid ""
"`BS_Linux` (in configuration: `Linux`) Like `Attach`, but break before "
"braces on function, namespace and class definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3268
msgid ""
"`BS_Mozilla` (in configuration: `Mozilla`) Like `Attach`, but break before "
"braces on enum, function, and record definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3320
msgid ""
"`BS_Stroustrup` (in configuration: `Stroustrup`) Like `Attach`, but break "
"before function definitions, `catch`, and `else`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3372
msgid "`BS_Allman` (in configuration: `Allman`) Always break before braces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3434
msgid ""
"`BS_Whitesmiths` (in configuration: `Whitesmiths`) Like `Allman` but always "
"indent braces and line up code with braces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3496
msgid ""
"`BS_GNU` (in configuration: `GNU`) Always break before braces and add an "
"extra level of indentation to braces of control statements, not to those of "
"class, function or other definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3561
msgid ""
"`BS_WebKit` (in configuration: `WebKit`) Like `Attach`, but break before "
"functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3610
msgid ""
"`BS_Custom` (in configuration: `Custom`) Configure each individual brace in "
"`BraceWrapping`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3617
msgid ""
"**BreakBeforeCloseBracketBracedList** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-"
"format 22` {ref}`¶ <BreakBeforeCloseBracketBracedList>`"
msgstr ""

