#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3633
msgid ""
"**BreakBeforeCloseBracketFunction** (`Boolean`) {versionbadge}`clang-format "
"22` {ref}`¶ <BreakBeforeCloseBracketFunction>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3635
msgid ""
"Force break before the right parenthesis of a function (declaration, "
"definition, call) when the parameters exceed the column limit."
msgstr ""

