"content and line breaking rules and penalties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangFormatStyleOptions.md:3713
msgid ""
"`BBCDS_Always` (in configuration: `Always`) Always break before `concept`, "
"putting it in the line after the template declaration."
msgstr ""

